GOTCHA (Caliper's ext/gotcha, also LLNL/GOTCHA develop as of 2026-11-16)
rewrites each library's GOT relocations from DT_JMPREL and then from DT_RELA
or DT_REL, choosing between the two from DT_PLTREL alone. A library linked
without a PLT (-fno-plt, as conda-forge builds hypre and mfem-dgns) has no
DT_PLTREL, so is_rela stays 0, GOTCHA looks for the absent DT_REL and skips
every GLOB_DAT entry: none of that library's MPI calls reach Caliper's mpi
service. Treat a library with DT_RELA and no PLT as RELA.

--- a/ext/gotcha/src/elf_ops.h
+++ b/ext/gotcha/src/elf_ops.h
@@ -176,6 +176,9 @@
       }                                                                 \
     }                                                                   \
   }                                                                     \
+  /* A library without PLT (-fno-plt) has no DT_PLTREL, but its GOT     \
+     relocations are in DT_RELA: walk them as RELA. */                  \
+  if (!jmprel && rela) is_rela = 1;                                     \
   jmprel_count =                                                        \
       jmprel_size / (is_rela ? sizeof(ElfW(Rela)) : sizeof(ElfW(Rel))); \
   if (rel) rel_count = rel_size / rel_esz;                              \
